sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant UI as WatchModeSettings (UI)
    participant Pre as preload (bridge)
    participant Co as Coordinator (recorder/index.ts)
    participant WS as WatchSource (watch-source)
    participant Ch as chokidar (源目录, 单目录)
    participant ET as ExternalTranscode (单例, 复用)
    participant UP as Upload (单例, 复用)
    participant Srv as 后端 /recording/*

    Note over UI,Srv: ── 正常新增文件（add 路径）──
    UI->>Pre: startWatch(roomId, token, folderPath)
    Pre->>Co: ipc recorder:startWatch
    Co->>WS: start(folderPath, options)
    WS->>Ch: watch(folderPath, ignoreInitial, awaitWriteFinish{2000,3000~5000})
    Ch-->>WS: (启动前旧文件被 ignoreInitial 过滤)
    Note over UI,Srv: 用户开始录制(未暂停) → 回放文件落盘
    Ch-->>WS: add(视频, 稳定后)
    WS->>WS: onAddFile: 扩展名✓ + Set✓ + manifest✗ → 入队 pending
    WS->>WS: pump(): running=true, inProgress.add
    WS->>Co: startExternalVideoTranscode(roomId, token, path, onJobDone)
    Co->>ET: startExternalTranscode(新建 extTmpDir uuid)
    ET->>UP: initUploader + onSegmentReady→enqueueUpload
    ET->>Srv: 边转边传 segments
    Co-->>Pre: recorder:transcodeExternal:progress
    Pre-->>UI: onExternalTranscodeProgress (pct)
    ET-->>Co: onComplete → handleExternalTranscodeComplete
    Co->>UP: waitForUploadQueue + finish
    Co->>Srv: POST /recording/finish (新 recording #1)
    Co->>WS: onJobDone(ok=true)
    WS->>WS: manifest.add(path); inProgress.delete; pump()下一个

    Note over UI,Srv: ── 暂停恢复（change 事件 → 重新转码，产生新 recording）──
    Note over Ch: 用户暂停→文件静态(无 change)；用户恢复→文件变大
    Ch-->>WS: change(视频, 变大, 稳定后)
    WS->>WS: onChangeFile: stabilized✓ & !inProgress & size>lastEnqueueSize
    WS->>WS: 重新入队(pending) + 更新 lastEnqueueSize
    WS->>WS: pump(): 同 path 再次 startExternalVideoTranscode
    Co->>ET: startExternalTranscode(**新 extTmpDir uuid**)
    ET->>Srv: 重新边转边传(分段落在新临时子目录, 不回写源)
    Co->>Srv: POST /recording/finish (**新 recording #2 / 新 sessionId**)
    Co->>WS: onJobDone(ok=true)
    Note over UI: 房间出现 2 个 recording；用户手动删除早期不完整片段(#1)

    Note over UI,Srv: ── 停止监听（决策#6：停止捡新 + 已排队跑完）──
    UI->>Pre: stopWatch()
    Pre->>Co: ipc recorder:stopWatch
    Co->>WS: stop() → watcher.close() (不再收 add/change)
    Note over WS: pump() 不中止：pending/inProgress 继续跑完
    WS->>Co: 剩余任务继续 startExternalVideoTranscode → finish
    Note over UI,Srv: 源文件留盘，下次启动可重捡(manifest 去重)
